{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t長沙灣有地盤發現懷疑戰時子彈，警方爆炸品處理課人員到場處理。<br/>\n<br/>\n警方昨日傍晚6時許接獲興華街3號一個地盤的工人報案，指發現兩枚懷疑炸彈，警員接報到場，發現兩枚二戰時期美製燃燒式子彈，分別長約15及17厘米，爆炸品處理課人員到場檢走，並將兩枚子彈安全處理，事件中無人受傷。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：許敬軒\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T18:44:18.410677+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T18:30:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T02:57:30.513502+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T18:37:49.897720+00:00","content_hash":"38960ab7a1332fe32e08b4b12420c3624d4d5b985b63592b7b4ff93287ffb535","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}